# Cursor / Antigravity local rules (complementary)

## Source of truth
- `AGENTS.md` is the primary contract.
- If any conflict appears, follow `AGENTS.md` and then fix stale docs.

## Session rule (memory zero)
- End of every session: update `NEXT.md`.
- Structural change: update `DECISIONS.md` and/or `docs/adr/*`.

## Execution rules
- Start with baseline and gates defined in `AGENTS.md`.
- Before concluding work, execute the canonical gate from `AGENTS.md`.
- Keep business logic outside UI files.
- Avoid dependency additions without approval.
- Prefer small, reversible diffs.
- Keep changes to 1 behavior and 3-5 main files when possible.
- Do not change sensitive configs without justification and green verify.
- Structural changes require ADR/decision and must be isolated from feature PRs.
- Require explicit plan + executed commands + objective evidence in delivery notes.

## Note
Do not assume this file is auto-loaded by every environment. Keep rules mirrored in versioned docs.
